   ΔT_b = K_b * m
   m = ΔT_b / K_b = 0.647°C / 32.10°C/mol = 0.02016 mol

5. **Calculate the molecular weight of the unknown solute:**
   Molecular weight of unknown solute = mass of unknown solute / moles of unknown solute
   Molecular weight = 0.6216 g / 0.02016 mol = 30.8 g/mol

