\[
\sum_{k=1}^n x^k = x + x^2 + \cdots + x^n = x \cdot \frac{x^n - 1}{x - 1} = \frac{x^{n+1} - x}{x - 1}.
\]
The third sum is:
\[
\sum_{k=1}^n 1 = n.
\]
