","To find the index of refraction (\( n \)) of the plastic for yellow light, we can use the formula:  \[
n = \frac{c}{v}
\]  where:  - \( c = 3.00 \times 10^8 \, \text{m/s} \) is the speed of light in a vacuum, and  - \( v = 0.680c \) is the speed of light in the plastic. Substituting the given values:  \[
n = \frac{3.00 \times 10^8 \, \text{m/s}}{0.680 \times 3.00 \times 10^8 \, \text{m/s}} = \frac{1}{0.680} \approx 1.47
\]  Thus, the index of refraction for yellow light in the plastic is \(\boxed{1.47}\).",relevance,"# Task Description
